Z||000008||FieroRacer||10-07-2001||02:21 PM||||Good job to the officers.  I know one of my earlier posts made it seem like I don't respect cops.  That's not true, I have alot of respect for them.  They keep the real reckless drivers and those dumb enough to drive drunk.  They also do their job to protect us despite alot of people maybe giving them crap.  I just wish they would partake in the Serve part once and a while.  Cops always tend to ingore me when I'm sitting somewhere with four ways on (Even in a damn intersection).  Oh well, as long as they help keep drunks off the road I feel safer and can drive with more confidence.||||reg||14
