Z||000011||Mach10||10-08-2001||03:17 AM||||Never had a complaint about the cops. Never pulled over for something I didn't deserve (132 in an 80  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"> ).<P>Now, CUSTOMS OFFICIALS on the other hand... Gimme a cream pie, a baseball hat, a pair of rubber gloves, a parking cone, a tube of KY and a sledgehammer... Use your imagination  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><P>Sounds like a G-r-r-r-r-eat day. I'm going into enforcement, but I'm not sure if I'm doing the peace officer bit, or just the lab-rat...||||reg||10
Z||000012||Ferrari_cdn||10-08-2001||04:01 AM||||132 in a 80!  Jeez, what were you doing?  Where was that?<P>I did do 125 on a 80 highway once, being in a hurry to U of M.     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  (Bishop Grandin hwy.)  And still was 125 entering the ramp and braked hard just before it turned to the right.<P>Would not 45 over again.<P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ferrari_cdn" TARGET=_blank>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ferrari_cdn.JPG">    </A>  <BR>AIM: CanadianFiero<p>[This message has been edited by Ferrari_cdn (edited 10-08-2001).]||||reg||4
Z||000013||fierohoho||10-08-2001||05:00 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR><BR>Now, CUSTOMS OFFICIALS on the other hand... Gimme a cream pie, a baseball hat, a pair of rubber gloves, a parking cone, a tube of KY and a sledgehammer... Use your imagination   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif">[/B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Mach that is way funny, it made my night and I've had a busy one.<P>Just starting my paperwork on drunk #2 for the weekend.<P>This guy was a .16 BAC and the roads are a little bit safer now,(his 4th DWI).<P>52 years old, he'll never learn.<P>A local trooper had picked up a drunk and was on his way into town when my guy came up behind the trooper at 77MPH with his highbeams on, trooper asks me to stop and chat with the guy about his driving so I do,walk up to the window and he rolls it down and I about fell over from the booze smell, fails the tests so he gets to wear the bracelets, but as he said in booking, "I had one drink 5-7 hours ago".<P>Yeah right <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">tell it to the Judge <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
