Z||000019||Master_Sushi||10-09-2001||12:01 AM||||""what's the fine for 76 in a 65 in New York state?""<P>HA, you probably dont want to know. I respect cops Allot, but they are TERRABLE here with speeders. Anything over 7 and you busted. On saturdays they seem to line up every few miles or so on the highways. I90 seems to be the worst. GOD niagara falls is a DUMP, youd think police could go into the ghetto and bust some law breakers insted of wasteing time pointing a radar gun at cars driving by, hiding behind an overpass.<P>I drive in canada allot and everybody seems to do 1-20kph over on the highways at least. Even the cops will, and I never see them hiding and taking radar. I've passed cops before on the QEW and such and they dont even mind.<P>sorry this is just on of the things that makes me mad...<p>[This message has been edited by Master_Sushi (edited 10-09-2001).]||||reg||13
